{
 "format": 1,
 "about": "The AE energy sword pack: CMT's energy sword (the evolved set's energy_sword from the stock-compatible source release of The Silent Cartographer: Evolved 1.4, no Open Sauce), its model taken as CMT made it for the third person, and for the first person CMT's mesh put on the node frames of ZTeam's first-person sword (frame handle, frame blades) so that ZTeam's first-person animations (idle, ready, moving, posing, melee, lunge, lunge in the air, grenade throws) move it, with ZTeam's melee and posing sounds, HUD, reticle and the picture of the sword for the prompts, each of ZTeam's taken as it is (an extra zip, --extra-zip zteam=...). CMT's release has no first-person sword, so the two views are two authors'. Only what an Xbox map needs is done: the models converted, the glow widgets and the detonation's boom left out, the pickup index the stock one's. The sword's swing and lunge are the game's (ae_sword_lunge.c). make_pack.py runs it; the locations of the zips, the stock map and the programs are given on its command line.",
